  "diagnosis": {
    "hair": "The v01 sRGB brown is correctly converted once to linear glTF COLOR_0. Godot ARRAY_COLOR packing truncates linear*255 to uint8: locks lose red/green separation and blue becomes zero, while darker scalp becomes red-only. The actual olive locks/red scalp agree with this deterministic colour loss. Grayscale hair PNG cannot introduce a green tint. No double-gamma fault is asserted.",
